# CR 608.2b: a spell whose every target is illegal as it resolves does not
# resolve at all -- none of its effects happen, the "you gain 3 life"
# sub-ability included (MagicStack.hasFizzled). human casts Lightning Helix
# at ai's Grizzly Bears and, keeping priority, Lightning Bolt at the same
# Bears. Bolt resolves first and the Bears die; Helix then has no legal
# target, so human stays at 20 and Helix goes to the graveyard.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 R
queue targets 6
queue targets 6
queue action human cast 1
queue action human cast 2
passpriority
